  "finalDifficulty": 0,
  "shortDescription": "As per our earlier discussion, I'm going to drop you right on top of a Baumann Group security outpost some 20 klicks from the <i>Dobrev</i>'s spaceport. You're going to have to capture the site and clear out its defenses. When the job's done, the Moderbjörn will use the complex's computers to drop the spaceport's defenses and remotely engage the <i>Dobrev</i>'s docking clamps. I'd expect the OpFor's defenses to run heavy on this one, so I'd advise building your lance accordingly.",
  "longDescription": "We're almost there, {COMMANDER.FirstName}. Just one more push and the derelict is ours.",
